<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Adidas details H1 1997 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Adidas details H1 1997 results.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			     238    vs 184</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			 352    vs 249</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		     294    vs 208</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		   5.24   vs 4.06 marks</p>
<p>    Group net sales				3,140  vs 2,242</p>
<p>    Group materials costs			1,808  vs 1,332</p>
<p>    Group gross profit			   1,332  vs 910</p>
<p>    Group marketing, admin and other costs 1,003  vs 676</p>
<p>    Group licencing and commission income  41     vs 51</p>
<p>    Group financial result		   6 profit vs 9 loss</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary earnings	     11     vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group taxes				    96     vs 52</p>
<p>    Group stock holdings			 1,281  vs 991</p>
<p>    Group equity				   763    vs 1,128</p>
<p>    Group depreciation			   35     vs 26</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear and equipment group is Adidas AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
